{"id":"f0ca199ab1107d90","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-numeral-examples.md","title":"Numeral Examples","display":"ex-numeral-examples — Numeral Examples","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-numeral-examples","aliases":["92-ex-numeral-examples"],"display":"ex-numeral-examples — Numeral Examples","depends_on":["[[92-df-numeral]]"],"source":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同","source_status":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-numeral-examples"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-numeral-examples</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-numeral-examples — Numeral Examples"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{\\cdot}\">\\(\\bar{\\cdot}\\)</span> (numeral map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\n\\bar0=0\\land\\bar1=S(0)\\land\\bar2=S(S(0))\\land\\bar3=S(S(S(0)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\overline{n+1}=S(\\bar n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\n\\bar0=0\\land\\bar1=S(0)\\land\\bar2=S(S(0))\\land\\bar3=S(S(S(0)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\overline{n+1}=S(\\bar n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span> : 自然数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>的形式化numeral</li>\n<li>这些等式由numeral映射的递归定义直接给出</li>\n<li>numeral是系统G中的项</li>\n<li>用于算术化：将自然数编码为形式项</li>\n<li>Gödel编码将numeral映射到Gödel数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar{\\cdot}$ (numeral map, see [[92-df-numeral]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\cdot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\n\\bar0=0\\land\\bar1=S(0)\\land\\bar2=S(S(0))\\land\\bar3=S(S(S(0)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\overline{n+1}=S(\\bar n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1034,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-384","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-ex-numeral-examples]]"}],"outgoing":["b78092e29a02d697"]}